{"ticker":"WELL","updated":"2026-11-20T23:27:23Z","profile":{"longName":"Welltower Inc.","shortName":"Welltower Inc.","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Healthcare Facilities","country":"United States","website":"https://www.welltower.com","fullTimeEmployees":712,"marketCap":176315793408,"trailingPE":101.83899,"forwardPE":80.78655,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":12.782712,"pegRatio":3.66,"targetMeanPrice":265.45456,"targetHighPrice":292.0,"targetLowPrice":230.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.384,"earningsGrowth":0.303,"grossMargins":0.3923,"operatingMargins":0.07179,"profitMargins":0.12083,"totalRevenue":13793300480,"beta":0.787,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":255.2,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":181.47,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.4},"summary":"Welltower Inc., an S&P 500 company, is positioned at the center of the silver economy, focusing on rental housing for aging seniors across the United States, United Kingdom, and Canada. Their portfolio of 2,500+ seniors and wellness housing communities are positioned at the intersection of housing and hospitality, creating vibrant communities for mature renters and older adults. They believe our real estate portfolio is unmatched, located in highly attractive micro markets with stunning built environments. Yet, Welltower is an unusual real estate organization as they view themselves as an operating company in a real estate wrapper, driven by highly aligned partnerships and an unconventional culture. Through their disciplined approach to capital allocation powered by their Data Science platform and superior operating results driven by the Welltower Business System - their end-to-end operating platform - they aspire to deliver long-term compounding of per share growth for their existing investors, North Star. Welltower Inc. was incorporated in 1970 in Delaware and is based in Toledo, Ohio.","summary_zh":"Welltower Inc. 是一家標準普爾 500 強公司，位於白銀經濟的中心，專注於為美國、英國和加拿大的老年老年人提供租賃住房。他們的 2,500 多名老年人和健康住房社區位於住房和酒店的交叉點，為成熟的租戶和老年人創造充滿活力的社區。他們相信我們的房地產投資組合是無與倫比的，位於極具吸引力的微型市場，擁有令人驚嘆的建築環境。然而，Welltower 是一家不同尋常的房地產組織，因為他們將自己視為房地產包裝中的營運公司，由高度一致的合作夥伴關係和非傳統文化驅動。透過由數據科學平台提供支援的嚴格資本配置方法以及 Welltower Business System（其端到端營運平台）驅動的卓越營運業績，他們渴望為其現有投資者 North Star 實現每股長期複合成長。 Welltower Inc. 於 1970 年在特拉華州註冊成立，總部位於俄亥俄州托萊多。","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh":"房地產投資信託基金 - 醫療保健設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":165.45,"h":167.74,"l":164.54,"c":167.42,"v":3535100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":168.47,"h":172.71,"l":167.88,"c":172.55,"v":3126300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":172.51,"h":173.22,"l":170.81,"c":170.97,"v":3678800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":171.46,"h":172.69,"l":170.89,"c":171.7,"v":2776300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":172.49,"h":175.1,"l":172.36,"c":174.9,"v":3167600},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":175.0,"h":177.23,"l":174.24,"c":176.2,"v":3427100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":176.53,"h":178.54,"l":176.53,"c":178.14,"v":4692300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":178.37,"h":180.4,"l":177.94,"c":179.38,"v":3106400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":178.92,"h":179.37,"l":174.89,"c":175.5,"v":3059000},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":175.38,"h":176.6,"l":175.0,"c":175.04,"v":2001400},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":174.04,"h":175.44,"l":173.15,"c":174.14,"v":1932200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":173.86,"h":174.0,"l":171.79,"c":173.0,"v":2241600},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":172.47,"h":172.81,"l":168.88,"c":169.14,"v":3116800},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":169.59,"h":170.07,"l":166.48,"c":167.27,"v":2420300},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":167.02,"h":167.96,"l":165.52,"c":165.94,"v":2538100},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":165.56,"h":166.89,"l":163.75,"c":166.85,"v":2155400},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":166.88,"h":169.48,"l":166.88,"c":169.34,"v":3481500},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":169.0,"h":173.36,"l":168.83,"c":172.34,"v":2862500},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":173.58,"h":173.72,"l":171.25,"c":172.08,"v":2631000},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":172.64,"h":175.66,"l":172.5,"c":175.09,"v":3152400},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":176.33,"h":177.94,"l":175.07,"c":177.71,"v":1901700},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":178.43,"h":178.63,"l":